			"description": "<ul><li>This is the core feature of the application, enabling face-to-face communication</li><li>It leverages WebRTC for efficient, low-latency, peer-to-peer connections</li><li>The application requests access to the user's camera and microphone to capture media</li><li>Each participant's video and audio stream is shared with every other participant in the room</li></ul>",
