					"simStepLabel": "Apply Positional Styles via CSS",
					"simStepDescription": "The `StyledNode` component, a styled-component, interprets the `top` and `left` props and injects them into its CSS template, applying `position: absolute` and setting the `top` and `left` style properties to position the avatar on the screen.",
