			"description": "<ul><li>Unlike traditional grid-based video calls, this application presents participants as movable avatars in a 2D space</li><li>Each participant's video is rendered inside a circular node</li><li>Upon joining, users are assigned a random position on the 2D stage</li><li>This spatial layout is the application's key unique selling proposition</li></ul>",
			"simulationNodesAndEdges": {
				"bdbdb355-20bc-472e-91b9-e0a2bf62f1cb": {
